<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 159 0 R
/T (Bank of CLI Part 3 brings the previous phases of the project together into a complete full-stack banking application. We connected the Angular frontend to a Spring Boot REST API, replaced mock data with real HTTP communication, persisted account and transaction data in PostgreSQL, added security with CSRF protection, and prepared the application for deployment on AWS.)
/E (Bank of CLI Part 3 brings the previous phases of the project together into a complete full-stack banking application. We connected the Angular frontend to a Spring Boot REST API, replaced mock data with real HTTP communication, persisted account and transaction data in PostgreSQL, added security with CSRF protection, and prepared the application for deployment on AWS.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
